Table: columns: [名称(name)] + [X: proj.x] + [Y: proj.y] + [画像: portrait]. Header cells clickable → set sort to that dim (mutate tag 投影 "排序 · <label> ↓"); same dim toggles dir. Row: click → toggle select + focus (mutate tag 选中). Selected rows class. Render first 60 rows + foot "显示 60 / 共 N 行（按 <label> 排序）".

Portrait:
