- cat/bool: horizontal bars with counts (others ghost + visible solid), click bar → toggle category in filter set (replace same-dim filter with new set; empty set removes filter). origin 类别点选.

Rail: each dim row: [badges X Y 色 像 序] label (unit) + spark canvas (48×16) mini dist. Badges show active roles. Row click → set portrait (if already portrait → nothing? maybe set portrait only; Enter=X etc. via keyboard). Row tabindex 0 (roving) role option aria-selected.

Spark: numeric: 18-bin bar row; cat: stacked proportion segments; bool: two segments.

Detail: focus row → list all dims label: value. Plus buttons? Keep read-only + "清除聚焦". Show also "已选中" indicator.

