Keyboard global: keydown: ctrl+z undo (preventDefault), ctrl+shift+z|ctrl+y redo, ctrl+0 reset? Ctrl+0 might conflict browser zoom reset — it IS browser reset zoom shortcut; use Ctrl+Backspace? Buttons suffice; keep Ctrl+Z/Y only, reset button only. Rail keydown handles Enter/Shift+Enter/p/c/s.

